        {
          "text": "Mu mweli gwa munane, mweli gwa Buli, mu muhiga gwa likomi na mulala gwi liamiiha lia Solomoni, liumbakwa lie Litembeli liatwekizwa kuli gaali nigalohizwa. Liali nilivuguyi Solomoni mihiga saba kuliumbaka.",
